  "extraction_notes": "[text-pass] The paper investigates AgSbTe2 and non-stoichiometric variations (Ag0.94Sb1.02Te2, Ag0.88Sb1.04Te2, Ag0.83Sb1.06Te2). These are treated as compositional variations rather than extrinsic doping, so no dopant_or_codopant entries were added. Electrical resistivity values were extracted as reported. [figure-pass p1-4] The paper discusses AgSbTe2 and variations in stoichiometry (Ag-Sb-Te ratios). The samples AST5050, AST4654, and AST4456 are treated as variations of the AgSbTe2 system. Property values were extracted from the body text where explicitly stated. ",
